| Block          | 从 BER 推出的核心 Spec                          | 晶体管级翻译                                           |
| -------------- | ----------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------ |
| Channel/TX FFE | main cursor、pre/postcursor                | tap current、driver swing、output (R)、DAC bits     |
| CTLE           | boost、zero、pole、linearity                 | (g_m,R_s,C_s,I_D,W/L)                            |
