| Sampler        | aperture jitter、(kT/C)、settling           | (C_s,R_{\mathrm{on}},W/L)                        |
| Comparator     | noise、offset、decision time                | input pair area、(g_{m,\mathrm{reg}},C_L)         |
| ADC            | ENOB、quantization noise、TI mismatch       | capacitor size、comparator、switch、calibration DAC |
| DFE            | residual ISI、tap range、tap precision      | current DAC units、matching area                  |
| CDR/PLL        | integrated jitter、JTOL、JTRAN              | VCO power、buffer (g_m)、loop BW                   |
